{"id":16825633506,"name":"Corridor","desc":"You are in a corridor. It will only end when all anomalies are reported; you are the one who does this job.\n\n[⚠]: - The game may sometimes have jumpscares and tense moments. If you have any problems with this, be careful while playing!\n\n[CONTROLS]: \nShift to Run for PC\nL2 to Sprint for CONSOLE\n\n[GUIDE]:\nAny anomaly seen in the corridor counts.\n- Report all anomalies at the end of the corridor to progress.\n- Don't let anyone pass.\n\nGame inspired by The Exit 8 on Steam.\n","path":"/game/16825633506-corridor","slug":"16825633506-corridor","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b853f36b21f758117d8414f5622893ca650ed94eba00736b8a2febedda8f6ef0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f5a4c142023c1971c1997023541def86/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":492,"visitor":47043558,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-05T10:57:54.170Z","creator":{"name":"Dreadworks Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Corridor-Roblox-corridor-script-esp-56599","_id":"68e24f32b03b3593cce0433e","title":"Script for","game":{"_id":"68e24f32b03b3593cce04336","gameId":16825633506,"name":"Corridor","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":16825633506},"features":"Update","tags":[],"script":"local target = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"MapSegments\")\nif target then\n    target = target:FindFirstChild(\"Segment000\")\n    if target then\n        target = target:FindFirstChild(\"Debris\")\n        if target then\n            target = target:FindFirstChild(\"John\")\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nif target and target:IsA(\"Model\") or target:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n    local highlight = Instance.new(\"Highlight\")\n    highlight.Name = \"JohnHighlight\"\n    highlight.FillColor = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 0) -- yellow\n   